    {
      "id": "claim_0fa9aec943f64f66ae58a1dcc6eb8dd7",
      "statement": "ChatOtClient state arrives through three independent, order-safe paths — setDurableState (chat metadata + composed epoch changes, also how generation bumps are learned: content-preserving bumps hand local buffers across the boundary, destructive ones discard them), pushRow (changeApplied rows deduped by generation+revision so subscribe-replay is harmless), and applyLocalChange for locally-authored edits.",
